    {
      "id": "2cccb754-68eb-49ee-84d7-f49063533188",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-03-07T11:45:00.000Z",
      "title": "Karnataka Bank Limited Announces Resignation of Independent Director Dr. D.S. Ravindran and Changes in Board Committees, Effective March 6, 2026",
      "body": "Karnataka Bank Limited has announced that Dr. D.S. Ravindran (DIN: 09057128) has tendered his resignation as a Non-Executive Independent Director of the Bank with effect from 9:00 PM on March 6, 2026. Consequent to his resignation as Independent Director, Dr. D.S. Ravindran ceased to be the member of the following Committees: IT Strategy Committee of the Board (Chairman), Audit Committee of the Board (Member), Stakeholders and Customer Relations Committee of the Board (Member), Corporate Social Responsibility Committee of the Board (Member). Dr. D.S. Ravindran stated that he had been renominated for a second term by the Board of the Bank, and since this resolution has not found favour with the shareholders of the Bank, he deemed it morally imperative to resign from the Board with immediate",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "23f295a7-0053-4952-aa22-41df287f93ff",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-02-16T13:33:00.000Z",
      "title": "Karnataka Bank Limited Announces Resignation of Pankaj Gupta as Chief Digital Officer & Head Digital Marketing, Effective February 16, 2026",
      "body": "Karnataka Bank Limited announced that Mr. Pankaj Gupta, Chief Digital Officer & Head Digital Marketing, has submitted his resignation from the services of the Bank on February 6, 2026, and his resignation is effective from the close of business hours of February 16, 2026. Mr. Pankaj Gupta served as the Chief Digital Officer & Head Digital Marketing for six years, contributing in creation of sustainable digital & analytics rails, that will shape the bank's future. Mr. Pankaj Gupta accordingly ceases to be a Senior Management Personnel of the Bank with effect from close of business hours of February 16, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f90b19e-fac3-4394-b75d-e1c63c193e26",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-11T11:42:11.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹7.69 (vs ₹7.51 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.69 (up from ₹7.51 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹10.00b (flat on 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.91b (up 2.6% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 29% (in line with 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 9% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 13% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
