      "title": "Karnataka Bank Ltd. Announces Resignation of Venkat Krishnan Veeramoni as Chief Information Officer & Chief Technology Officer, Effective February 6, 2026",
      "body": "Karnataka Bank Ltd. announced that Mr. Venkat Krishnan Veeramoni has resigned from the services of the Bank on January 31, 2026, and his resignation is with effect from the close of business hours of February 6, 2026. Mr. Venkat Krishnan Veeramoni served as Chief Information Officer & Chief Technology Officer of the Bank. Reason for the resignation is he would be unable to travel to Mangalore for family reasons.",
